   <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm ea-example ai-example-question" data-question="Search documents and explain common reasons applications are returned during quality control">Analyse quality control return reasons</button>
  </div></section>
 </div><div class="col-xl-9 col-lg-8">
  <section class="ea-card mb-4"><div class="ea-chat"><div class="ea-chat-head"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3"><div class="ea-robot"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i></div><div><h5>ELIS AI Database Assistant</h5><small>PostgreSQL + PostGIS + pgvector + RAG + LLM</small></div></div><div class="d-flex gap-2"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-light" id="ai_btn_export_chat" type="button"><i class="fas fa-download me-1"></i>Export</button><button class="btn btn-sm btn-light" id="ai_btn_clear_chat" type="button"><i class="fas fa-trash me-1"></i>Clear</button></div></div>
   <div class="ea-messages" id="ai_chat_messages"><div class="ea-message assistant"><div class="ea-avatar">AI</div><div class="ea-bubble">Hello. I can help you query ELIS information using natural language.<br><br>I can combine:<ul class="mb-1"><li>transactional database records;</li><li>PostGIS parcel and spatial data;</li><li>vector database searches;</li><li>OCR and document content; and</li><li>AI reasoning over retrieved information.</li></ul>Try asking: <strong>“Show pending applications older than 30 days and group them by workflow stage.”</strong><span class="ea-time">Just now</span></div></div><div class="ea-typing" id="ai_typing_indicator"><div class="ea-avatar">AI</div><div class="ea-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div>
   <div class="ea-compose"><form id="ai_chat_form" autocomplete="off"><div class="ea-input-row"><textarea id="ai_user_input" rows="1" placeholder="Ask about applications, parcels, ownership, workflows, documents or spatial data..." required></textarea><button class="ea-send" id="ai_send_btn" type="submit"><span class="ai-send-text"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane me-1"></i>Send</span></button></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2"><small class="text-muted">Enter to send · Shift + Enter for a new line</small><small class="text-muted"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt me-1"></i>AI access follows your ELIS permissions</small></div></form></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="ea-card"><div class="ea-card-head"><strong><i class="fas fa-chart-bar me-2"></i>AI Analysis Results</strong><div id="ai_route_display"><small>No query executed</small></div></div><div class="ea-card-body">
   <div class="row g-2 mb-3" id="ai_stats_row"><div class="col-lg-3 col-6"><div class="ea-stat"><small>Records</small><strong id="ai_stat_records">0</strong></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-6"><div class="ea-stat"><small>Documents</small><strong id="ai_stat_documents">0</strong></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-6"><div class="ea-stat"><small>Parcels</small><strong id="ai_stat_parcels">0</strong></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-6"><div class="ea-stat"><small>Confidence</small><strong id="ai_stat_confidence">--</strong></div></div></div>
   <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="ai_result_tabs" role="tablist"><li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" id="ai_answer_tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#ai_answer_pane" type="button"><i class="fas fa-comment-alt me-1"></i>Answer</button></li><li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" id="ai_records_tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#ai_records_pane" type="button"><i class="fas fa-table me-1"></i>Records</button></li><li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" id="ai_map_tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#ai_map_pane" type="button"><i class="fas fa-map me-1"></i>Map</button></li><li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" id="ai_evidence_tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#ai_evidence_pane" type="button"><i class="fas fa-file-alt me-1"></i>Evidence</button></li><li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" id="ai_query_tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#ai_query_pane" type="button"><i class="fas fa-code me-1"></i>Query Details</button></li></ul>
   <div class="tab-content pt-3" id="ai_result_tab_content"><div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="ai_answer_pane"><div id="ai_answer_empty" class="ea-empty"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i>Ask the assistant a question to begin analysis.</div><div id="ai_answer_content" class="d-none"><div class="ea-answer" id="ai_answer_text"></div></div></div>
   <div class="tab-pane fade" id="ai_records_pane"><div id="ai_records_empty" class="ea-empty"><i class="fas fa-table"></i>Database records returned by the AI query will appear here.</div><div id="ai_records_content" class="d-none"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm table-hover table-bordered" id="ai_result_table"><thead><tr id="ai_result_table_header"></tr></thead><tbody id="ai_result_table_body"></tbody></table></div></div></div>
   <div class="tab-pane fade" id="ai_map_pane"><div id="ai_database_map"></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2"><small class="text-muted">AI spatial results appear here when GeoJSON or WKT is returned.</small><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" id="ai_btn_clear_map" type="button"><i class="fas fa-eraser me-1"></i>Clear AI Layer</button></div></div>
   <div class="tab-pane fade" id="ai_evidence_pane"><div id="ai_evidence_empty" class="ea-empty"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i>Supporting documents, vector matches and references will appear here.</div><div id="ai_evidence_list" class="d-none"></div></div>
   <div class="tab-pane fade" id="ai_query_pane"><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Query Route</label><div id="ai_query_route_details" class="border rounded p-2 bg-light mb-3">No query executed.</div><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Generated SQL</label><pre id="ai_generated_sql" class="ea-query">No SQL generated.</pre><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Spatial / PostGIS Query</label><pre id="ai_generated_spatial" class="ea-query">No spatial query generated.</pre><label class="form-label fw-semibold">Vector Search</label><pre id="ai_generated_vector" class="ea-query">No vector search performed.</pre></div></div>
  </div></section>
 </div></div>
